Package: vaevictis-tools
Version: 1.2.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: linuxtuts-website <292920559+linuxtuts-website@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://vaevictisos.org
Description: fixed VaeVictis tools for systems installed from VaeVictis OS 1.1
 Puts fixed versions of the VaeVictis tools in place of the copies that the
 1.1 image installed, at the same paths: the app sandbox, the VPN manager and
 its helper, the VPN polkit rule, v-snap and the panic button.
 .
 A copy is replaced only if it is exactly a version VaeVictis shipped. Copies
 changed locally, or from 1.0 and 1.0.1, are left alone, and a missing tool is
 not added. The replaced copies are kept in /var/lib/vaevictis-tools/backup.
 Removing this package does not restore them.
 .
 A hobby project written by AI and never audited: provided as is, without
 warranty (GPL-3.0). Part of VaeVictis OS.
